{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56993","headline":"中宗时（京师）人爲郑愔语（题拟） · 佚名","name":"中宗时（京师）人爲郑愔语（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杀郑愔，天必阴。\n（同前）（〖1〗《册府元龟》：「郑愔謟事武三思及韦氏悖逆庶人，历选吏侍郎。\n愔掌选，专以卖官爲务，人多怨讟。\n时京师大旱，爲之语曰〖语略〗。\n其爲人所恶如此。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}